<title>USA: Fairfield Communities pursues share offer.</title>
<headline>Fairfield Communities pursues share offer.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fairfield Communities Inc said its board authorized the company to pursue a public offering of about 1.1 million shares during the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The proceeds would be used to satisfy existing obligations, the vacation ownership company said.</p>
<p>Physicians Insurance Co of Ohio and its subsidiaries also are considering including all or part of their about 1.73 million share holding in Fairfield in the offering, Fairfield said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
